      "text": [
        " قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ ( صلى الله عليه وآله ) الْبَيِّنَةُ عَلَى مَنِ ادَّعَى وَ الْيَمِينُ عَلَى مَنِ ادُّعِيَ عَلَيْهِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ali Bin Ibrahim, from his father, from Ibn Abu Umeyr, from Hammad, from Al Halby, from Jameel and Hisham, ",
          "Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> has said: ‘Rasool-Allah<sup>saww</sup> said: ‘The (burden of) proof is upon the one who claims, and the (swearing of) the oath is upon the one who is claimed against (defendant)’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "1. Ali ibn Ibrahim has narrated from his father from ibn abu ‘Umayr from Hammad from al-Halabiy from Jamil and Hisham who has narrated the following: “Abu ‘ Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said that the Messenger of Allah, O Allah, grant compensation to Muhammad and his family worthy of their services to Your cause, has said, ’Establishing testimony (the burden of proof) is on the plaintiff and oath is on the defendant.”’ "
        ]
      }
    },
